ble":false},"id":"checks-panel","slots":{"content":[{"config":{"description":{"$i18n":"overview.checks.cleanBody"},"icon":"circle-check","title":{"$i18n":"overview.checks.cleanTitle"}},"id":"checks-clean","slots":{"actions":[{"config":{"icon":"refresh-cw","label":{"$i18n":"overview.checks.run"},"variant":"secondary"},"id":"checks-run","type":"Button"}]},"type":"EmptyState"}]},"type":"Stack"},{"config":{"dashed":true,"description":{"$i18n":"overview.empty.description"},"icon":"app-window","title":{"$i18n":"overview.empty.title"},"visible":false},"id":"overview-empty","slots":{"actions":[{"config":{"icon":"refresh-cw","label":{"$i18n":"shell.refresh"},"variant":"secondary"},"id":"overview-empty-refresh","type":"Button"}]},"type":"EmptyState"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"},{"config":{"label":{"$i18n":"shell.primaryNav"}},"id":"tabbar","slots":{"content":[{"config":{"icon":"layout-dashboard","label":{"$i18n":"nav.overview"},"selected":true},"id":"tab-overview","type":"TabBarItem"},{"config":{"icon":"app-window","label":{"$i18n":"nav.views"},"selected":false},"id":"tab-views","type":"TabBarItem"},{"config":{"icon":"workflow","label":{"$i18n":"nav.flows"},"selected":false},"id":"tab-flows","type":"TabBarItem"},{"config":{"badge":"5","badgeTone":"annotation","icon":"inbox","label":{"$i18n":"nav.reviews"},"selected":false},"id":"tab-reviews","type":"TabBarItem"}]},"type":"TabBar"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"RootShell"},"name":"Overview & readiness","spec":{"accessibility":["The page has one level-1 heading (\"Overview\"); the attention items are real buttons with their full text as the accessible name and 44px touch targets on tablet and phone.","Table headers are visible on desktop and tablet; on phones each card repeats the field labels so meaning never depends on column position.","Readiness and evidence states pair color with an icon and a word.","No text renders below 12px in any Locale; controls use 13px and prose 14px, and zh-TW line heights grow by about 2px.","Light and dark themes meet WCAG 2.2 AA contrast for text and controls."],"constraints":["The Overview never edits canonical resources; export and navigation are its only actions.","Green appears only for success (Clean, implementation-ready); blocked readiness uses fault red with an icon and a count.","Visual language follows the Quiet Canvas design system in DESIGN.md: graphite chrome, Iris violet only for selection, focus and the single primary action per region, Marker magenta only for human annotation, and status hues only in badges, icons and alerts.","Every visible string is bound with $i18n. en-US and zh-TW keep identical key sets; zh-TW uses Taiwan Traditional Chinese with full-width punctuation and keeps domain nouns (View, Variant, Widget, Workspace, Review, Spec, UX Flow, Handoff, Adapter, Locale, Asset, Decision, Owner, Checks, Evidence) in English.","Identities and measurements stay literal and use the mono blueprint register: Widget ids such as #checkout-submit, Widget type names, revisions, keyboard keys and CLI commands are never translated."],"decisions":[],"entryConditions":["A signed-in member opened the Workbench root or chose Overview in the Rail or TabBar.","Readiness is computed by the same assessment as assess_handoff_readiness; the page only presents it.","The render context selects one Workspace viewport preset (desktop 1920 × 1080, tablet 1024 × 768, or mobile 390 × 844), one Locale (en-US default or zh-TW), and one theme (light or dark). All twelve combinations are authored and captured explicitly."],"intent":"Answer \"what needs me, and what is ready to hand off?\" at a glance: an attention headline, then every View with its Reviews, Checks, Evidence and Handoff readiness, so an Owner can export implementation-ready work and unblock the rest.","interactionRules":["The headline lists what needs attention as display-size buttons: waiting for review, open threads, and blocked Views. Each one navigates to the matching filtered list; \"waiting for review\" opens the Reviews inbox.","Tabs switch between Views, Checks and Activity. The Views tab shows a sortable table: View, Feature, Reviews, Checks, Evidence and Readiness.","Readiness reads \"implementation-ready\" only when the closure has fresh complete Evidence, no open or ready-for-review Review threads and no blocking diagnostics; otherwise it names the number of blocking issues.","Evidence shows fresh and stale capture counts; stale means the View, Locale or render-context preset changed since capture.","\"Export handoff…\" opens the Handoff export for the selected roots.","The Checks tab lists Checks findings grouped by problem; with none it shows \"No Checks findings\" and a Run Checks action (checks-tab Variant).","An empty Workspace shows \"No Views yet\" with the create_view hint and a Refresh action (empty-workspace Variant).","Layout derives from the viewport width only: 1280px and wider shows the 264px Rail, the main region and (where present) a 340px right panel; 640–1279px collapses the Rail to a 56px icon rail and moves the right panel to on-demand; below 640px the Rail is replaced by the 56px bottom TabBar. On phones each table row becomes an outlined card with labelled fields."],"references":[{"label":"Resolution kinds that close a thread for readiness","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/7#discussioncomment-18757815"},{"label":"Member identity, roles, tokens and agent edit leases","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/1#discussioncomment-18758344"},{"relation":"attention-target","type":"view","viewId":"468247e8-4f39-4f04-8056-b2af4c1c37ea"},{"relation":"row-target","type":"view","viewId":"7f3d7780-3cb9-4e57-8f0b-2e8d569905c1"}]},"variants":{"checks-tab":{"state":{"checks-panel":{"visible":true},"otab-checks":{"selected":true},"otab-views":{"selected":false},"views-section":{"visible":false}}},"empty-workspace":{"state":{"attention":{"visible":false},"overview-empty":{"visible":true},"views-section":{"visible":false}}}}}
